The MIT licence above covers the code. Two things in this repository are not
covered by it:

static/corpus/ contains sentences from the Tatoeba Project
(https://tatoeba.org), used under CC BY 2.0 FR
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/). If you redistribute them,
that licence applies and the attribution has to come with them.

src/lib/charts/ contains ordered-dither code ported from dither-kit
(https://tripwire.sh/dither-kit, https://github.com/Boring-Software-Inc/dither-kit),
Copyright (c) Boring Software Inc., MIT licensed.
